### 1. Create task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Submit Python practical",
  "description": "Complete and submit journal",
  "status": "pending"
}

### 2. Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

### 3. Get one task
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6af890859bd6ea9643beab6c

### 4. Update task
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6af890859bd6ea9643beab6c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### 5. Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6af890859bd6ea9643beab6c
### 6. Delete duplicate 1
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6af892349bd6ea9643beab6d

### 7. Delete duplicate 2
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6af8928e9bd6ea9643beab6e